{"ID":"20240522082247-dj9eykr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240522082247-dj9eykr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082247-dj9eykr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522093651-s1ddqa6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522093653-plgfatn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522093651-5mg024r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"陳醫師的急性膽道阻塞","type":"doc","updated":"20240522093657"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522093651-s1ddqa6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-s1ddqa6","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診，98.1.5，男，43歲"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-va1wr1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-va1wr1o","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸脅部肌肉疼痛，嘔而發熱，胃部會不適，大陽穴有脹痛，之前感冒服大青龍湯，沒有好，大便一天一行，質可，眠差，咽乾，口不苦，微口渴，小便色中黃，項部緊。左脈弦濇數，右脈：沉弦緊數"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-s0rog8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-s0rog8k","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辨證：太陽少陽併病，膽府瘀熱，尚未成實。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-vmqqvpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-vmqqvpa","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-4vhz57z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-4vhz57z","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"科中：（克）（一日份）"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-sfz5yhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-sfz5yhv","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小柴胡湯9、芒硝1.5、葛根2、白芍1.5。六天"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-66h9g9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-66h9g9i","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-6l3i6je","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-6l3i6je","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二診：98.1.10，患者98.1.09，膽囊部痛劇難忍，急診住院，今日其夫人從醫院，代其拿藥，證狀為胸脅部肌肉痛，西醫診為胃中積水水腫，膽道阻塞，脾胰腫，嘔吐，發熱，心下及胸脅硬滿，痛劇，納差。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-3kj4axt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-3kj4axt","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辨證：少陽腑實。（上方可能是科中藥力不夠或某因）"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-puxw5y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-puxw5y3","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方水藥：（錢）"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-1vd6v31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-1vd6v31","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡6黃芩3生薑3半夏3大黃2生白芍3枳實5紅棗3，二天，9碗水煮3碗，三餐飯後服。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-2h4w909","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-2h4w909","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-2bqr7kr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-2bqr7kr","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三診：98.1.12"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-id8grro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-id8grro","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昨日出現發熱，已不吐，但有噁心感，腹微脹，膽囊部痛減，胰脾區不痛，雙手脈為浮緩數，舌紅苔淡黃厚。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-dmv6weo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-dmv6weo","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辨證；少陽府實已去大半，且轉出太陽。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-5xks5yi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-5xks5yi","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水藥：（錢）"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-ai3irdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-ai3irdn","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡4黃芩2生薑3半夏3大黃1.5生白芍3枳實4紅棗3桂枝3炙甘草2，二天，9碗水煮3碗，三餐飯後服。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-j4cyxky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-j4cyxky","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-1lhmhfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-1lhmhfu","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四診：98.1.14"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-71vrt5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-71vrt5q","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"膽囊部偶爾微痛，微熱，睡時汗出，納呆，大便一天二三行，水泄，質可，不渴，眠淺，咽乾，小便色中黃至深黃，量可，目睛黃，舌紅苔黃厚。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-y8yptbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-y8yptbr","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辨證：少陽腑實已近全去，尚有餘熱。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-atd3z5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-atd3z5p","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"科中："}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-81hc66i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-81hc66i","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡2枳實3芍藥2炙甘草1.5川楝子1.5茵陳蒿2金錢草1生薑1，七天"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-z99kvqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-z99kvqq","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-6a8yl6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-6a8yl6c","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五診：98.1.19"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-q4138up","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-q4138up","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泛酸，納可，大便一日一行，便軟，小便色深黃，小便量可，口微渴，腹脹，舌紅苔黃白厚，眠差，睡不深，倦怠，口不苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-vgbjoew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-vgbjoew","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辨證：心下痞，少陽餘熱。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-fnpkjng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-fnpkjng","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"科中處方：（克）"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-mpfe2jr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-mpfe2jr","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"旋覆代赭石湯9茵陳五苓散5，二天。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-iaolj0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-iaolj0r","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-480vg8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-480vg8a","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六診：98.1.23"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-7317lil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-7317lil","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"諸證皆去。請開保養肝膽之藥。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-rc646nh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-rc646nh","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"後記："}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-jgfd01l","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-jgfd01l","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522093651-mbis0go","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-mbis0go","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522093651-8c727n3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-8c727n3","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者痛住院時，西醫一直叫他把膽拿掉，但患者及其夫人是師父的粉絲，閱讀了漢唐的文章，知道膽一拿掉，十年後就有可能變肝結石（西醫說成肝硬化），他的同事就是有這種例子，所以拒絕。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-ip1zm13","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-ip1zm13","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522093651-jeipv03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-jeipv03","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者在98.1.12,其夫人要求出院，西醫師就把患者叫至診間，做什麼呢？當然是好好恐嚇一番，膽沒拿掉會怎樣…，患者有點被嚇到，不過因為其有一個賢內助，所以堅持出院，西醫無可奈何，只好請患者簽自願出院同意書。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-543442j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-543442j","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"弟子陳醫師報告至此。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093655-is3lrk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093655-is3lrk3"}},{"ID":"20240522093651-5mg024r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-5mg024r","updated":"20240522093657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-x06jnqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-x06jnqn","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   讀者用Common sense想一下，如果把膽道阻塞跟膽切除二者放在一起比較一下，看看哪種較好時，你就會發現到，膽道就算有些阻塞，但是膽還在啊，只要飲食上做些改變，吃些中藥讓其通暢就好了，如果將膽切除，就是沒有膽了，將來面臨的問題就是終生阻塞，所以開刀切除膽遠比膽道阻塞更壞，所以這種病不去治療的結果卻比給西醫治療的結果，還要來得好些，台灣真該要全力發揚中醫藥，否則將來必將成為全世界排名第一的病痛之島了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093651-vundcfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093651-vundcfm","updated":"20240522093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記2009年02月07日"}]},{"ID":"20240522093652-csl8ox9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522093652-csl8ox9"}},{"ID":"20240522093653-plgfatn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093653-plgfatn"}}]}